# Round 100, the other half: with round 99 typing function arguments as
# "gen" and round 100 dispatching on them, a numeric-classified called
# param can no longer HOLD a function -- a caller passing one through a
# numeric channel dies at its OWN unbox and never enters the callee. So
# the numeric class is now evidence, and the #168 "higher-order parameter
# is not yet typed" message it used to print here was stale: the param
# really does hold a number. The VM's own message is the honest one, and
# emitting it turns a divergence into a byte-exact match.
define f(cb) as:
    return cb of 1
n is 5
print of (f of n)
